  "description": "Elephant-shaped seats give the Jumbo Four Seater Merry-Go-Round its name. Four children each sit on a colourful elephant while the platform turns, and the seat shape gives them something solid to hold. It is meant for the 3 to 9 years Key User Group, so it works in a primary school as well as a society play area. The platform is 6'8\" in diameter, slightly larger than our standard four seater, and the safe play area is a 12'8\" circle. The elephants come in multi colour and make a strong theme piece for a park. Roto-moulded seats and galvanised pipes carry a 3-year warranty, with 1 year on bearings. Ask us for a layout drawing of your play area.",
