    "items": [
     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Elephant-shaped seats give the Jumbo Four Seater Merry-Go-Round its name. Four children each sit on a colourful elephant while the platform turns, and the seat shape gives them something solid to hold. It is meant for the 3 to 9 years Key User Group, so it works in a primary school as well as a society play area. The platform is 6'8\" in diameter, slightly larger than our standard four seater, and the safe play area is a 12'8\" circle. The elephants come in multi colour and make a strong theme piece for a park. Roto-moulded seats and galvanised pipes carry a 3-year warranty, with 1 year on bearings. Ask us for a layout drawing of your play area."
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "component": "ProductSpecifications2",
   "props": {
    "pText": "Each elephant seat is roto-moulded and bolted to a galvanised steel platform. Installation is self-standing or grouted, depending on your ground. A turning platform of 6'8\" needs room for children to step off safely, so keep the 12'8\" circle clear and inspect the seat fixings and bearing during maintenance.",
